  "modal.title": "Isaziso",
  "modal.text": "Zivakashi ezithandekayo! Isikhumba ngasinye esikule galari siwumphumela wamahora amanengi womsebenzi. Izikhumba ezenziwe ngumdali wewebhusayithi zivikelwe ngamalungelo obunikazi: ukuzibuka kuvunyelwe, kodwa ukuzidawuniloda, ukuzikopa lokuzisebenzisa kwezentengiselwano kudinga isivumelwano sangaphambili. Ezinye izinto (amajazi, ukwakheka kwamabhulokhi lezitshalo, njll.) ngezabadali bazo ababalulwe emibhalweni yemifanekiso, njalo zisetshenziswa ngokwemibandela yamalayisensi abo. Siyabonga ngokuqonda langokwethembeka kwenu! Khumbulani ukuthi lena isevisi ye-Minecraft engeyikusemthethweni. Ayivunyelwanga ngu-Mojang kumbe ngu-Microsoft njalo ayihlangene labo. Abanikazi bewebhusayithi yibo abanomthwalo wayo, hatshi u-Mojang lo-Microsoft.",
